# The context is services/ (the uv workspace root). Send only what the image
# installs: the workspace files, comfyctl's source, and comfyrelay's project
# metadata, which uv reads to load the workspace but does not install.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!comfyctl/pyproject.toml
!comfyctl/README.md
!comfyctl/comfyctl/
!comfyrelay/pyproject.toml
!comfyrelay/README.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
